@startuml
title Create Topic Sequence (/api/admin/topics)
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Admin
boundary "Create Topic UI" as CreateTopicPage
control "TopicsController\n(FE Dashboard)" as DashboardController
entity "AdminTopic\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeTopicDto
entity "CreateTopicRequest\n(BE Request DTO)" as TopicRequestDto
entity "TopicSummaryResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as TopicResponseDto
control "AdminTopicsController\n(BE API)" as ApiController
control "ITopicAdminService" as ITopicAdminService
control "TopicAdminService" as TopicService
entity "Topic" as TopicEntity
entity "Word" as WordEntity
entity "WordTopic" as WordTopicEntity
control "ITopicAdminRepository" as ITopicAdminRepository
control "TopicAdminRepository" as TopicRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
note over CreateTopicPage, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Dashboard TopicsController posts create data through VocaNovaApiClient.
API uses CreateTopicRequest and returns TopicSummaryResponse.
FE response DTO exists: AdminTopic for duplicate topic checks.
CreateTopicRequest can include word_ids for initial topic vocabulary.
Interfaces used in code: ITopicAdminService, ITopicAdminRepository.
end note
Admin -> CreateTopicPage: Open create topic page
Admin -> CreateTopicPage: Enter topic name,\nVietnamese name?, icon?, words?
Admin -> CreateTopicPage: Submit form
CreateTopicPage -> DashboardController: POST /topics/create
DashboardController -> DashboardController: Validate form input\nand selected words
alt Form input invalid
DashboardController --> CreateTopicPage: Show validation message
else Form input valid
DashboardController -> ApiController: VocaNovaApiClient.GetAdminTopicsAsync()\nGET /api/admin/topics
ApiController -> FeTopicDto: HTTP 200 OK\nAdminTopic JSON
FeTopicDto --> DashboardController: Existing topics
alt Topic name already exists
DashboardController --> CreateTopicPage: Show duplicate topic message
else Topic can be submitted
DashboardController -> TopicRequestDto: VocaNovaApiClient.CreateTopicAsync(input)\nCreate request data(topic_name, topic_name_vi?,icon?, word_ids?)
TopicRequestDto -> ApiController: POST /api/admin/topics\nCreateTopicRequest
ApiController -> ApiController: Check admin authorization
ApiController -> ApiController: Validate CreateTopicRequest
alt Request validation fails
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 400 error
DashboardController --> CreateTopicPage: Show error message
else Request validation success
ApiController -> ITopicAdminService: CreateAsync(create data)
ITopicAdminService -> TopicService: CreateAsync(create data)
TopicService -> ITopicAdminService: Normalize topic data
ITopicAdminService -> TopicService: Normalize topic data
TopicService -> ITopicAdminRepository: NameExistsAsync(topicName, topicNameVi)
ITopicAdminRepository -> TopicRepository: NameExistsAsync(topicName, topicNameVi)
TopicRepository -> DbContext: Query duplicate topic name
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT topics
MySQL --> DbContext: Topic row or null
DbContext -> TopicEntity: Materialize Topic?
TopicEntity --> DbContext: Topic or null
DbContext --> TopicRepository: Result
TopicRepository --> TopicService: exists or not
alt Topic name already exists
TopicService --> ApiController: Conflict result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 409 error
DashboardController --> CreateTopicPage: Show error message
else Topic name is available
TopicService -> ITopicAdminRepository: WordIdsExistAsync(wordIds)
ITopicAdminRepository -> TopicRepository: WordIdsExistAsync(wordIds)
TopicRepository -> DbContext: Check selected vocabulary words
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT words
MySQL --> DbContext: Word rows count
DbContext -> WordEntity: Materialize Word rows
WordEntity --> DbContext: Words
DbContext --> TopicRepository: Result
TopicRepository --> TopicService: valid or invalid
alt Selected word id invalid
TopicService --> ApiController: Validation failure
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 400 error
DashboardController --> CreateTopicPage: Show error message
else Selected words valid
TopicService -> ITopicAdminRepository: CreateAsync(create data)
ITopicAdminRepository -> TopicRepository: CreateAsync(create data)
TopicRepository -> TopicEntity: Create or restore Topic
TopicEntity --> TopicRepository: Topic
TopicRepository -> DbContext: Add or track Topic
DbContext -> MySQL: INSERT/UPDATE topics
MySQL --> DbContext: Save result
opt word_ids supplied
TopicRepository -> DbContext: Add topic word links
TopicRepository -> WordTopicEntity: Create WordTopic links
WordTopicEntity --> TopicRepository: WordTopic links
DbContext -> MySQL: INSERT word_topics
MySQL --> DbContext: Save result
end
DbContext --> TopicRepository: Topic summary
TopicRepository --> TopicService: Created topic
TopicService --> ApiController: Return created topic
ApiController -> TopicResponseDto: Create response data(TopicSummaryResponse)
TopicResponseDto --> DashboardController: HTTP 201 Created\nTopicSummaryResponse
DashboardController --> CreateTopicPage: Redirect to topic list
end
end
end
end
end
@enduml
